{
  "id": "soft_or_hard_water",
  "title": "Soft or Hard Water",
  "description": "Calculate water hardness based on dissolved minerals. Water hardness is a function of the amount of dissolved calcium, magnesium, iron, aluminum, and manganese salts.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Water Hardness Calculator\n\n**Hard water** contains dissolved minerals, primarily calcium and magnesium salts, iron and aluminum. Total hardness can be calculated based on the concentrations of these minerals.\n\n## Classification\n\n| Classification | mg/L (ppm) | gpg |\n|---|---|---|\n| Soft | 0 - 60 | 0 - 3.5 |\n| Moderate | 61 - 120 | 3.5 - 7 |\n| Hard | 121 - 180 | 7 - 10.5 |\n| Very Hard | > 180 | > 10.5 |\n\n*1 ppm = 0.058 grains/US gallon*"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "calcium_ppm",
          "label": "Calcium",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ppm",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "magnesium_ppm",
          "label": "Magnesium",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ppm",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "iron_ppm",
          "label": "Iron",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ppm",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "manganese_ppm",
          "label": "Manganese",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ppm",
          "defaultValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_hardness_ppm",
          "label": "Total Hardness",
          "unit": "ppm CaCO₃",
          "formula": "(inputs.calcium_ppm * 2.497) + (inputs.magnesium_ppm * 4.115) + (inputs.iron_ppm * 1.792) + (inputs.manganese_ppm * 1.822)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_hardness_gpg",
          "label": "Total Hardness",
          "unit": "gpg",
          "formula": "((inputs.calcium_ppm * 2.497) + (inputs.magnesium_ppm * 4.115) + (inputs.iron_ppm * 1.792) + (inputs.manganese_ppm * 1.822)) * 0.058",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "hardness_classification",
          "label": "Water Classification",
          "formula": "IF(((inputs.calcium_ppm * 2.497) + (inputs.magnesium_ppm * 4.115) + (inputs.iron_ppm * 1.792) + (inputs.manganese_ppm * 1.822)) <= 60, 'Soft', IF(((inputs.calcium_ppm * 2.497) + (inputs.magnesium_ppm * 4.115) + (inputs.iron_ppm * 1.792) + (inputs.manganese_ppm * 1.822)) <= 120, 'Moderate', IF(((inputs.calcium_ppm * 2.497) + (inputs.magnesium_ppm * 4.115) + (inputs.iron_ppm * 1.792) + (inputs.manganese_ppm * 1.822)) <= 180, 'Hard', 'Very Hard')))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "type": "gauge",
        "title": "Water Hardness Level",
        "data": [
          {
            "name": "Hardness",
            "value": 0
          }
        ],
        "min": 0,
        "max": 300,
        "splitNumber": 4,
        "axisLine": {
          "lineStyle": {
            "width": 30,
            "color": [
              [
                0.25,
                "#67b26f"
              ],
              [
                0.5,
                "#FFD700"
              ],
              [
                0.75,
                "#FF8C00"
              ],
              [
                1,
                "#FF4500"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        "pointer": {
          "itemStyle": {
            "color": "auto"
          }
        },
        "axisTick": {
          "distance": -30,
          "length": 8,
          "lineStyle": {
            "color": "#fff",
            "width": 2
          }
        },
        "splitLine": {
          "distance": -30,
          "length": 30,
          "lineStyle": {
            "color": "#fff",
            "width": 4
          }
        },
        "axisLabel": {
          "color": "auto",
          "distance": 50,
          "fontSize": 16
        },
        "detail": {
          "valueAnimation": true,
          "formatter": "{value} ppm",
          "color": "auto"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}